  'lid' => '5952',
  'source' => 'Text fields that allow text formats are those with "formatted" in the description. These are <em>Text (formatted, long, with summary)</em>, <em>Text (formatted)</em>, and <em>Text (formatted, long)</em>. You cannot change the type of field once a field has been created.',
